Don't show it to anyone, that face of yours,

294
00:30:01,896 --> 00:30:03,636
もう 透明で きっと
Already transparent, for sure

295
00:30:03,636 --> 00:30:06,236
無加工だけれど
Unprocessed as I am, but

296
00:30:06,236 --> 00:30:07,776
でも
still,

297
00:30:07,776 --> 00:30:10,176
だから叫んで
that's why I'll shout,

298
00:30:10,176 --> 00:30:13,256
あがいて 裸のまま走れねぇ
struggle, and run completely bare.

299
00:30:13,833 --> 00:30:16,193
傷ついて 教えてよ
Getting hurt, tell me

300
00:30:16,193 --> 00:30:17,893
答えは
what the answer is.

301
00:30:22,803 --> 00:30:25,643
こんな 僕の心までばかり
Not just about my heart

302
00:30:25,643 --> 00:30:28,243
じゃなくてさ
and things like that, you know,

303
00:30:28,423 --> 00:30:30,343
繋いで
connect with me.

304
00:30:46,155 --> 00:30:49,515
ガイドの文字が笑っている どうか
The guide signs are laughing, please,

305
00:30:49,515 --> 00:30:53,495
足音にも 重くなる
even my footsteps are growing heavy.

306
00:30:55,405 --> 00:30:58,385
これも枯らして 叫んで あがいて
For this too, I'll shout, struggle,

307
00:30:58,385 --> 00:31:01,425
私ね 走り続けて
and keep running on,

308
00:31:02,425 --> 00:31:05,205
笑えないように 諦めないように
so I won't stop smiling, so I won't give up,

309
00:31:05,205 --> 00:31:08,025
繋ぎつづるだけに
just patching things together—

310
00:31:08,067 --> 00:31:11,687
繋ぎつづるだけじゃ駄目だ
Just patching things together isn't enough.

311
00:31:14,380 --> 00:31:16,940
見つけてよ 僕を
Find me,

312
00:31:16,940 --> 00:31:22,960
僕の この声が聴こえてる
can you hear this voice of mine?

313
00:31:23,280 --> 00:31:27,100
ダンサイン ザ ダーク 死のへと するもう
Dancing in the dark, heading toward fading out...

314
00:31:27,866 --> 00:31:30,386
透明で きっと
Transparent, for sure

315
00:31:30,386 --> 00:31:33,486
無加工だけれど
unprocessed as I am, but

316
00:31:33,486 --> 00:31:35,146
でも
still,

317
00:31:35,146 --> 00:31:37,386
せめて これも
at least, even this—

318
00:31:37,386 --> 00:31:40,286
ガラスのような
like glass,

319
00:31:40,286 --> 00:31:43,106
景色にしがみついて
clinging to the scenery,

320
00:31:43,106 --> 00:31:46,086
もっと 正面を願うと痛い
wishing for the spotlight hurts all the more.

321
00:32:23,282 --> 00:32:25,842
あの黄昏も
That twilight too,

322
00:32:25,842 --> 00:32:28,222
折り畳めば
if folded up,

323
00:32:28,222 --> 00:32:30,702
始ま
begins—

324
00:32:30,702 --> 00:32:34,062
僕らの街じゃ 繋がりは いつだ
in our town, when is connection ever found?

325
00:32:34,062 --> 00:32:36,762
灯りを消して
Turn off the lights,

326
00:32:36,762 --> 00:32:40,222
始めよう 幕を開け
let's begin, raise the curtain,

327
00:32:40,222 --> 00:32:43,422
見上げ願いを あなたのように
looking up and wishing, just like you—

328
00:32:43,422 --> 00:32:46,482
必ず会っていたい
I definitely want to meet you.

329
00:32:46,482 --> 00:32:49,822
きらめきのベルも 音符に
The twinkling bell too, into notes

330
00:32:49,822 --> 00:32:53,422
気持ちを描いて
sketching my feelings.

331
00:32:55,171 --> 00:32:58,351
待ち焦がれたその日
That long-awaited day

332
00:32:58,351 --> 00:33:00,941
いまだに胸の中で
is still inside my chest,

333
00:33:00,941 --> 00:33:04,001
太陽の熱を巡らせて
circulating the heat of the sun.

334
00:33:04,001 --> 00:33:06,161
雷鳴の残像
The afterimage of thunder,

335
00:33:06,161 --> 00:33:10,101
逃げ出したくて 焦がれた空を
wanting to run away, straddling the yearning sky—

336
00:33:12,801 --> 00:33:15,581
夜が明けるまでは
Until dawn breaks,

337
00:33:15,581 --> 00:33:19,461
もう少し このままで
just a little longer like this.

338
00:33:30,270 --> 00:33:32,890
あの鐘の音は
That sound of the bell

339
00:33:32,890 --> 00:33:35,390
鳴り止まなくて
won't stop ringing,

340
00:33:35,390 --> 00:33:38,270
まるで 人間だらけ
as if surrounded by people.

341
00:33:38,270 --> 00:33:41,050
集まろう 夜深くまで
Let's gather late into the night,

342
00:33:41,050 --> 00:33:43,730
未来の話を
talking about the future,

343
00:33:43,730 --> 00:33:46,410
積み重ねてきた日々に
in these days we've piled up.

344
00:33:46,410 --> 00:33:49,070
近いよ 世界に
It's close—in a world

345
00:33:49,070 --> 00:33:52,250
魔法がかかっていたって
where magic has been cast,

346
00:33:52,250 --> 00:33:56,330
夢は続いていく
the dream goes on.

347
00:33:56,330 --> 00:33:59,070
おやすみに変わるよ
Turning into a "good night,"

348
00:33:59,070 --> 00:34:02,390
鳴りやまない メロディ 届けて
delivering an unending melody.

349
00:34:02,390 --> 00:34:05,170
見逃すな
Don't miss it,

350
00:34:05,170 --> 00:34:08,570
止まれ 僕らの目撃者だ
stop, we are the eyewitnesses.

351
00:34:08,570 --> 00:34:12,650
すぐに手も伸ばした 水平線が歌い出したって
Even if we reached out our hands right away and the horizon started singing,

352
00:34:12,650 --> 00:34:16,530
止められない 僕らを繋ぐ 縦橋は立ったんだ
the vertical bridge connecting us cannot be stopped—it has risen.

353
00:34:16,530 --> 00:34:22,330
いつの一日 止まれ 君に届くまでさ
Every single day, stop, until it reaches you—

354
00:34:22,330 --> 00:34:26,590
何度でも 呼び声を
no matter how many times, calling out your voice,

355
00:34:26,590 --> 00:34:30,590
奇跡に変わって
turning it into a miracle.

356
00:34:30,590 --> 00:34:34,390
トラッシュ 清浄の果て
Trash, at the end of purity—

357
00:34:34,390 --> 00:34:37,450
どこまででも
no matter how far,

358
00:34:47,870 --> 00:34:53,350
人生なんて 語り尽くせない 悲劇も
Life's tragedies can never be fully told,

359
00:34:53,350 --> 00:34:59,924
人生中 語り合わせたら 喜劇になっていく
but if we share them all together, they turn into a comedy.

360
00:35:00,726 --> 00:35:02,886
ねえ 聞かせてよ
"Hey, let me hear it,"

361
00:35:04,296 --> 00:35:07,596
一筋の さだめ
"A single ray of destiny,"

362
00:35:09,186 --> 00:35:11,426
また泣いた 撃たれた
"Crying again, shot down,"

363
00:35:11,486 --> 00:35:14,446
今だけ決めた 命よ
"A life decided for just now."

364
00:35:14,886 --> 00:35:17,466
毎夜の眠れずで
"Sleepless every single night,"

365
00:35:17,646 --> 00:35:20,166
抱いたそうさ 握りしめて
"Holding you tight, grasping on,"

366
00:35:20,426 --> 00:35:26,606
朝まだき 空を跨ぐ 潮よりも契ったな 約束の そこで
"Crossing the dawn sky, pledged more than the tide, right there at our promised place."

367
00:35:26,906 --> 00:35:30,346
此処で巡るまでは 何処へも
"Wherever we wander from this place,"

368
00:35:32,846 --> 00:35:35,366
また明日
"See you tomorrow."

369
00:35:39,026 --> 00:35:41,926
灰か爛れ 君が選りすぐれる
"Ash or rot, which will you choose?"

370
00:35:42,286 --> 00:35:46,706
僕たちの 物語
"Our story."

371
00:35:52,466 --> 00:35:54,066
ありがとうございました！
"Thank you very much!"

372
00:36:03,506 --> 00:36:05,206
え、今何時？
"Eh, what time is it?"

373
00:36:07,186 --> 00:36:08,626
え？
"Eh?"

374
00:36:10,566 --> 00:36:18,286
えっとね、この後ね、19時半から「ゾンビゾンビゾンビ」のミュージックビデオが公開されるんだけど、過ぎてないよね？
"Umm, after this, at 7:30 PM, the music video for 'Zombie Zombie Zombie' will be released, but we haven't passed that yet, right?"

375
00:36:21,066 --> 00:36:32,466
是非みんなで一緒に観ましょう。そして21時から配信がありまして、23時から地下の「0-TOKYO」で「MIDNIGHT STELLAR」というクラブイベントも開催されます。
"Let's all watch it together. And starting at 9 PM there's a stream, and from 11 PM a club event called 'MIDNIGHT STELLAR' at 0-TOKYO in Chika will be held."

376
00:36:33,006 --> 00:36:37,946
色んなスタッフもDJするみたいなので、ぜひ楽しんでいってください！
"Various staff members will be DJing too, so please enjoy it!"

377
00:36:40,906 --> 00:36:48,766
えっとですね、実はこの上のっでかいビジョンあるよね？ ここでMV流れます。
"Umm, you see, actually, there's that big screen up there, right? The MV will play right here."

378
00:36:52,386 --> 00:36:56,566
あの、プレミア公開と一緒に観てもらえたら嬉しいんだけど、どう？
"Um, I'd be happy if you could watch it along with the premiere, how's that?"

379
00:36:59,666 --> 00:37:00,666
ありがとう。
"Thank you."

380
00:37:00,786 --> 00:37:09,966
えー、YouTubeの方向け、えー、この配信が終了した直後に概要欄にあるURLに飛んでもらえると大変嬉しいです。
"Umm, for those on YouTube, um, I'd be very happy if you could jump to the URL in the description right after this stream ends."

381
00:37:10,426 --> 00:37:14,786
現地にいるみんなはぜひ残ってここで一緒に観てください！
"Everyone here in person, please stay and watch it together here!"

382
00:37:17,266 --> 00:37:30,986
そして現地にいる人に、ろ、ろう、ゾンビゾンビゾンビのミュージックビデオが流れ終わった後に、とある告知動画が流れます。
"And for those here in person, ro-, ro-, after the 'Zombie Zombie Zombie' music video finishes playing, a certain announcement video will play."

383
00:37:32,046 --> 00:37:37,086
ぜひそこまで見てから帰っていただけますとありがたいです。
"I'd appreciate it if you could watch until then before heading home."

384
00:37:37,986 --> 00:37:44,086
あ、そのあと、あの、Twitterにも載せるから、あのYouTubeのみんなもね、安心してね。
"Ah, after that, um, I'll post it on Twitter too, so everyone on YouTube, don't worry."

385
00:37:45,366 --> 00:37:46,766
え、名残惜しいね。
"Ah, it's bittersweet, huh?"

386
00:37:48,866 --> 00:37:52,926
え、もうね、もう台本にはね、それでは星街すいせいでした、バイバイって書いてあるんだよ、名残惜しいね。
"Um, you know, the script already says 'That was Hoshimachi Suisei, bye-bye,' it's so bittersweet."

387
00:37:55,386 --> 00:37:59,386
名残惜しい。え、なんか最後にさ、言ってほしい言葉とかある？
"Bittersweet. Um, is there anything you want me to say at the very end?"

388
00:38:02,446 --> 00:38:04,286
わかりました。
"Understood."

389
00:38:06,246 --> 00:38:08,586
ばちこーん！
"Bang!"

390
00:38:13,486 --> 00:38:15,586
ばちこーん！
"Bang!"

391
00:38:18,266 --> 00:38:25,646
あとは、あとは？ え？
"What else, what else? Eh?"

392
00:38:26,606 --> 00:38:30,386
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
"Zombie, zombie, zombie!"

393
00:38:31,086 --> 00:38:35,446
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！また！
"Zombie, zombie, zombie! Again!"

394
00:38:36,246 --> 00:38:45,446
ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！ラストだ！ゾンビゾンビゾンビ！
"Zombie, zombie, zombie! Zombie, zombie, zombie! This is the last one! Zombie, zombie, zombie!"

395
00:38:46,386 --> 00:38:55,926
ありがとう！このあともミュージックビデオ見てくださいね！それでは星街すいせいでした！バイバイ！
"Thank you! Please keep watching the music video afterwards! This was Hoshimachi Suisei! Bye-bye!"

396
00:38:57,056 --> 00:39:35,056
ZOMBIE! ZOMBIE!! ZOMBIE!!! HOSHIMACHI SUISEI HALLOWEEN LIVE
[Title: ZOMBIE! ZOMBIE!! ZOMBIE!!! HOSHIMACHI SUISEI HALLOWEEN LIVE]

